Package: com.ma6x9x.kernellab
Name: Kernellab
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: userspace micro-lab for iOS/XNU kernel research, plus a
 SpringBoard app shell that runs this CLI. Pick a saved kernelcache
 (target.json), survivor-diff pinned method tables across two builds,
 and dry-run the allowlisted userspace stub (sim ident). 26.5 is 23F77
 and 27.0 is 24A435 (24A437 is the unpinned 27.0-family cache). The
 Apple-submit gate stays closed. JB-rig kernel testing is not a fileable
 finding. The Probes tab only lists operator-supplied sources. No
 kernelcaches included (operator-supplied).
Maintainer: kolby <noreply@github.com>
Author: kolbymaxx
Section: Research
Depends: python3
Homepage: https://github.com/ma6x9x/KernelLab
